  "solution": {
    "text": "<p>Hyperbola,&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfrac><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><msup><mi>a</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></mfrac><mo>-</mo><mfrac><msup><mi>y</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><msup><mi>b</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>&#160;&#160;&#8658;</mo><mfrac><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mn>4</mn></mfrac><mo>-</mo><mfrac><msup><mi>y</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mn>5</mn></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mtext>&#8756;&#160;</mtext><msup><mi>a</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>=</mo><mn>4</mn><mo>,</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><msup><mi>b</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>=</mo><mn>5</mn></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msup><mi>b</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>=</mo><msup><mi>a</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mfenced><mrow><msup><mi>e</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#8658;</mo><mn>5</mn><mo>=</mo><mn>4</mn><mfenced><mrow><msup><mi>e</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced></math></p><p>&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><msup><mi>e</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>5</mn><mn>4</mn></mfrac><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>9</mn><mn>4</mn></mfrac></math></p><p>&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi>e</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>3</mn><mn>2</mn></mfrac></math></p><p><math> <mrow> <mo>&#8756;</mo> </mrow> </math>&nbsp;Extremity of <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>L</mi><mi>R</mi></math>&nbsp;in first&nbsp;quadrant&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mtext>&#8801;</mtext><mi>L</mi><mtext>&#8801;</mtext><mfenced><mrow><mi>a</mi><mi>e</mi><mo>,</mo><mfrac><msup><mi>b</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mi>a</mi></mfrac></mrow></mfenced></math></p><p>&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8801;</mo><mfenced><mrow><mn>3</mn><mtext>,&#160;</mtext><mfrac><mn>5</mn><mn>2</mn></mfrac></mrow></mfenced></math></p><p>Equation of tangent to the hyperbola&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfrac><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><msup><mi>a</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></mfrac><mo>-</mo><mfrac><msup><mi>y</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><msup><mi>b</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></math> at&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced><mrow><msub><mi>x</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo>,</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><msub><mi>y</mi><mn>1</mn></msub></mrow></mfenced></math>&nbsp;is&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfrac><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>&#8289;</mo><mi>x</mi><msub><mo>&#8289;</mo><mn>1</mn></msub></mrow><msup><mi>a</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></mfrac><mo>-</mo><mfrac><mrow><mi>y</mi><mo>&#8289;</mo><mi>y</mi><msub><mo>&#8289;</mo><mn>1</mn></msub></mrow><msup><mi>b</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mfrac><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>&#8289;</mo><mo>&#183;</mo><mn>3</mn></mrow><mn>4</mn></mfrac><mo>-</mo><mfrac><mrow><mi>y</mi><mo>&#183;</mo><mfenced><mfrac><mn>5</mn><mn>2</mn></mfrac></mfenced></mrow><mn>5</mn></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></math></p><p>&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>3</mn><mi>x</mi><mo>&#8289;</mo></mrow><mn>4</mn></mfrac><mo>-</mo><mfrac><mrow><mi>y</mi><mo>&#8289;</mo></mrow><mn>2</mn></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></math></p><p>To find the point <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>A</mi></math> on <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>x</mi></math>--axis, put&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>y</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></math></p><p><math> <mrow> <mo>&#8658;</mo> <mi></mi><mi>x</mi><mo>&#8289;</mo> <mo>=</mo> <mfrac> <mrow> <mn>4</mn> </mrow> <mrow> <mn>3</mn> </mrow> </mfrac> </mrow> </math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi>O</mi><mi>A</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>4</mn><mn>3</mn></mfrac></math></p><p>To find the point <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>B</mi></math> on <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>y</mi></math>-axis, put&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>x</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></math></p><p><math> <mrow> <mo>&#8658;</mo> <mi></mi><mi>y</mi><mo>&#8289;</mo> <mo>=</mo> <mo>-</mo> <mn>2</mn> </mrow> </math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi>O</mi><mi>B</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn></math></p><p>Now,&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>O</mi><msup><mi>A</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>-</mo><mi>O</mi><msup><mi>B</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>16</mn><mn>9</mn></mfrac><mo>-</mo><mn>4</mn><mo>=</mo><mo>-</mo><mfrac><mn>20</mn><mn>9</mn></mfrac><mo>.</mo></math></p>"
  }
